.TH ORO-NETWORK-STATUS 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:network\-status \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:network\-status'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Android network path state. Connectivity never establishes server health, account authorization, or permission to retry an uncertain operation.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBgetStatus()\fR
Reads Android's current default path without making a network request. Other platforms and disabled monitoring reject with `ENOSYS`.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<NetworkStatus>\fR
.TP
\fBonChange(callback)\fR
Observes native network path changes. Subscribe before reading `getStatus()` to obtain an initial snapshot without missing later changes. This function does not start polling or probe any application server.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIcallback\fR ((status: NetworkStatus) => void; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fI() => void\fR Removes the listener.
